    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just a \"temporary response\" though. it feels deeper than that. like, even if things got better for a bit, it wouldn't change how exhausting it is just to exist. i feel like i'm just a burden to everyone around me and honestly, is it ever actually okay to just give up on everything for good?",
